          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "To completely remove **Node.js** from Termux, follow these steps:  \n\n### **1. Uninstall Node.js**  \nRun the following command to remove Node.js:  \n```sh\npkg uninstall nodejs -y\n```\n\n### **2. Remove Node.js-Related Files**  \n```sh\nrm -rf ~/.npm ~/.nvm ~/.node-gyp ~/.config/yarn\nrm -rf /data/data/com.termux/files/usr/lib/node_modules\n```\n\n### **3. Verify Removal**  \nCheck if Node.js is still installed:  \n```sh\nnode -v\n```\nIf you get `command not found`, it is successfully removed.\n\nLet me know if you need more help!"
